  "details": "Currently whenever you make an Expression Menu control (item) on an avatar you can set Name, Image and etc. However those values cannot be changed on the fly whilst wearing the avatar with a FX Layer Controller or anything similar.\n\nWhat Im proposing is that those values be open to be changed (via an FX Layer or otherwise) on the fly.\n\nExample: A Discord OSC mute/deaf toggle, upon toggling the \"Mute\" toggle with a white microphone icon it changes to a \"Unmute\" toggle with a red crossed out microphone icon.",
